        		</li>
        	</ol>
        	</li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="2" style="margin-left:40px">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Nineteen dollars ($19) for private fire hydrants.</span></span></li>
        </ol>
        
        <ol start="4" style="list-style-type:upper-alpha">
        	<li style="text-align:justify"><span style="font-family:Calibri,sans-serif"><span style="font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Safety/Building &amp; Multi-Family Inspections.</span></span></li>
